OL,3,ADame Esther Rantzen, broadcaster,
OL,4,Acampaigner and charity founder, dies
OL,5,Aaged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther Rantzen has died aged 86
OL,9,FShe was known for presenting the BBC TV
OL,10,Fprogramme, That's Life, and later went
OL,11,Fon to set up Childline, the helpline
OL,12,Ffor children suffering abuse or neglect
OL,14,FRecently, she had campaigned for the
OL,15,Flegalisation of assisted dying
OL,17,FHer family have paid tribute to her as
OL,18,Fthe "most wonderful mother" and a
OL,19,F"cherished grandmother"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
